    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/8b43baebea140b69ac619ff80e6ec40c.avif?t=1710605339\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Get ready for an enchanting escapade with Arcanora, the ultimate rouge-lite magical adventure that'll sweep you back to the pixel-perfect nostalgia of retro gaming! Plunge into the depths of a dark labyrinth, where you'll dance with danger, battling an array of spine-tingling spiders. Wield an impressive assortment of staffs, each boasting its own unique abilities to thwart the eight-legged invaders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/2a9e2331c8e3f5d470a4014f51762a27.avif?t=1710605339\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/4ef1943934a4961ea7214cd39bf061c3.poster.avif?t=1710605339\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/4ef1943934a4961ea7214cd39bf061c3.webm?t=1710605339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/4ef1943934a4961ea7214cd39bf061c3.mp4?t=1710605339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/a034fc1e078c220debc65b2ebd9dacb7.avif?t=1710605339\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583890/extras/3b1debc23a88b4f526b9b6660d6cec4e.poster.avif?t=1710605339\" width=600 height=256 ><source s